    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Right in the heart of Galway City, this superbly finished three-story oozes character and offers an exceptional city living experience - clients will truly appreciate the convenience this property offers with everything right on their doorstep. Given the location, you certainly do not require a car, but you may apply for a parking permit if required.\r\n\r\n*Full concierge services are available on request inc housekeeping.\r\n\r\nInterior Features:\r\n\r\n• Modern Classic Design: The townhouse boasts a timeless yet contemporary design, marrying the best of both worlds. Wooden floors and modern interiors create a warm and inviting atmosphere throughout the entire space.\r\n\r\n• Comfortable Bedrooms: Enjoy restful nights on brand-new beds paired with luxury mattresses in two double bedrooms. One of these bedrooms features an ensuite bathroom, adding an extra touch of convenience and privacy.\r\n\r\n• Efficient Home Office: The dedicated home office on the second floor is a haven of productivity. Equipped with multiple data points running on high-speed fibre broadband, you'll have a seamless connection for all your needs.\r\n\r\n• Modern Amenities: Stay comfortable year-round with Wi-Fi-controlled heating, ensuring your home is always at the perfect temperature, effortlessly controlled at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nLayout:\r\n\r\n• Ground Floor: You'll find an inviting entrance hallway with storage space upon entering.\r\n\r\n• First Floor: The first floor features a well-appointed kitchen, a spacious living room for relaxation with plenty of natural light, utility for convenience, and a stylish main bathroom.\r\n\r\n• 2nd floor: Two double bedrooms (one ensuite) and a Home office with multiple data points running on fibre broadband.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nThis townhouse's location is truly unbeatable. Nestled in the heart of Galway City, you'll have easy access to the Galway's vibrant culture, dining, shopping, and entertainment options. Everything is moments away, whether you're strolling along the picturesque streets or enjoying the lively Corrib walks.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this opportunity.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nPSRA LICENCE NO.004198"
      },
